      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "STOKEY THE BEAR (2) turned in a better run last time to find a minor placing (22.14) at this track behind Beep in a Grade 5. Has the pace to be prominent. Likely to feature again. RADCLIFF (1) finished 1.5 lengths away in second last start over 380m at this track but in a solid 21.68. Expecting another bold showing. HARA'S HASTY (7) broke from the inside draw and filled a minor placing last start, beaten only a nose (28.69) behind Cocoa Express at this track. Didn't win last time but still ran one of the quickest times on the card. Well placed and gets her chance. DAISY RAY (8) was strongly fancied last time on the back of a win two back but could only manage second (21.95) at this track. Yet to win out of this box but has been in the placings two times from three starts.",
